Rename the embedded storage engine config surface from `embedded_hamt` to `embedded_db` (and `SYNAPSE_EMBEDDED_HAMT_ENGINE`/`SYNAPSE_EMBEDDED_HAMT_PATH` to `SYNAPSE_EMBEDDED_DB_ENGINE`/`SYNAPSE_EMBEDDED_DB_PATH`), since it now stores event JSON, edges, auth chains, redactions and more besides HAMT state.
